Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: SCSI Ribbon Bleeds
- Story & Context: Julian dragged an obsolete rackmount sampler through ankle-deep brine inside the flooded lobby of the old Municipal Archive, only to find the ribbon cables rusted shut and buzzing against the machine's casing. Hooking the broken rig to a gas generator on the roof, Thorne grabbed the mic as rain hit the bell of the horn, locking into the crackling noise loop with the warning shout, "Dry your feet before you step across the copper." The session ran uninterrupted until the breaker blew, leaving a crowd of sixty people standing in utter silence above the dark tide.
